{"id":"fbd3170495a52979","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-hereditary-conservativity.md","title":"Hereditarily Gamma-Conservative Sentences","display":"df-hereditary-conservativity — Hereditarily Gamma-Conservative Sentences","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-hereditary-conservativity","aliases":["67-df-hereditary-conservativity"],"display":"df-hereditary-conservativity — Hereditarily Gamma-Conservative Sentences","depends_on":["[[67-df-partially-conservative]]","[[67-df-PA]]","[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_chapter":5,"source_label":"Exercise 5(b), definition only","source_printed_pages":[71],"source_pdf_pages":[82],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"definition-and-signature-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-hereditary-conservativity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-hereditary-conservativity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hereditary-conservativity — Hereditarily Gamma-Conservative Sentences"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d04e3c8a5885c18\" href=\"?note=5d04e3c8a5885c18\" title=\"67-df-partially-conservative\">67-df-partially-conservative</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" href=\"?note=ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Exercise 5(b), definition only"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>71</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>82</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-and-signature-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 是 r.e. 公理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" href=\"?note=ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsSent}_\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsSent}_\\Gamma\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5d04e3c8a5885c18\" href=\"?note=5d04e3c8a5885c18\" title=\"67-df-partially-conservative\">67-df-partially-conservative</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HConsSent}_\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathrm{HConsSent}_\\Gamma\\)</span> 为下式定义的二元谓词；中间理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 在原书理论约定下取 r.e. 公理集，包含关系按演绎扩张表达。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HConsSent}_\\Gamma(\\varphi,T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{REAx}(S)\\land(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{PA}\\;S\\vdash\\alpha)\\land(\\forall\\beta\\in S\\;T\\vdash\\beta)\\to\\mathrm{ConsSent}_\\Gamma(\\varphi,S)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HConsSent}_\\Gamma(\\varphi,T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{REAx}(S)\\land(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{PA}\\;S\\vdash\\alpha)\\land(\\forall\\beta\\in S\\;T\\vdash\\beta)\\to\\mathrm{ConsSent}_\\Gamma(\\varphi,S)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应印刷71页/PDF82页习题5(b)开头的定义：在 PA 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 之间每个理论上都保守。不能只检查原公理集的字面子集；对等价呈示采用演绎包含。这里只提取习题中给出的定义，没有把后续要求证明的加强结论标成已证定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-partially-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"5d04e3c8a5885c18","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-partially-conservative]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REAx}$ 采用 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]；$\\mathrm{ConsSent}_\\Gamma$ 采用 [[67-df-partially-conservative]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-partially-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"5d04e3c8a5885c18","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REAx}$ 采用 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]；$\\mathrm{ConsSent}_\\Gamma$ 采用 [[67-df-partially-conservative]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REAx}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConsSent}_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HConsSent}_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HConsSent}_\\Gamma(\\varphi,T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall S\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{REAx}(S)\\land(\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{PA}\\;S\\vdash\\alpha)\\land(\\forall\\beta\\in S\\;T\\vdash\\beta)\\to\\mathrm{ConsSent}_\\Gamma(\\varphi,S)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1961,"backlinks":[{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-65","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-hereditary-conservativity]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-39","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-hereditary-conservativity]]"}],"outgoing":["5d04e3c8a5885c18","cd051851df5d2aa2","ae4400eaf5ddc9a9"]}